  "content": "<p><em><strong>這個模組讓箭矢擊中生物時不會消失，而是會在生物死亡時以物品形式掉落。</strong></em></p><p>建議搭配「穿透箭矢」之類的模組遊玩，這樣你才能真正看到插在生物身上的箭矢。</p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em>本模組使用 MCreator 製作&nbsp;</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdont-void-arrows\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth 頁面</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p><em><strong>查看我的其他模組：</strong></em></p><p><em><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/monster-hunter-villager\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/904/182/638354148166598269.png\" alt=\"魔物獵人村民\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/monstrous-slimes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/930/440/638403264768147418.png\" alt=\"巨型史萊姆\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yoshis-random-things\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/919/475/638381729117633371.jpeg\" alt=\"耀西的隨機物品\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cataclysmic-creepers\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/888/526/638327113429388003.png\" alt=\"災變苦力怕\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/paper-and-cardboard\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/885/928/638322024567415536.png\" alt=\"紙與紙板\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-falling\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/907/264/638358230142431941.png\" alt=\"更好的墜落\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a></strong></em></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dark-side-creatures\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/919/93/638380942855441364.jpeg\" alt=\"暗黑生物\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.